          "id": "imported-text-0-0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "<h1><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16px;\">Hi there! Nice to e-meet you.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"></span></h1><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);\">I’m a PhD candidate working at the intersection of construction safety, immersive VR, and eye tracking. I’m interested in how digital technologies can help us better understand and improve safety training.</span></p><p>Happy to connect, share experiences, and discuss ideas.<span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);\"></span></p>"
        },
